name: ['Aether Vial', 'Arcbound Ravager', 'Black Vise', 'Cataclysmic Gearhulk', 'Chalice of the Void', "Champion's Helm", 'Chromatic Lantern', 'Chrome Mox', 'Cloudstone Curio', 'Combustible Gearhulk', 'Crucible of Worlds', 'Defense Grid', 'Duplicant', 'Engineered Explosives', 'Ensnaring Bridge', 'Extraplanar Lens', 'Gauntlet of Power', 'Grindstone', 'Hangarback Walker', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Lotus Petal', 'Mana Crypt', 'Mana Vault', 'Meekstone', "Mind's Eye", 'Mox Opal', 'Noxious Gearhulk', 'Oblivion Stone', 'Ornithopter', "Painter's Servant", 'Paradox Engine', 'Pithing Needle', 'Planar Bridge', 'Platinum Angel', 'Rings of Brighthearth', 'Scroll Rack', 'Sculpting Steel', 'Sol Ring', 'Solemn Simulacrum', 'Sphere of Resistance', 'Staff of Domination', 'Static Orb', 'Steel Overseer', 'Sundering Titan', 'Sword of Body and Mind', 'Sword of Feast and Famine', 'Sword of Fire and Ice', 'Sword of Light and Shadow', 'Sword of War and Peace', 'Torrential Gearhulk', 'Trinisphere', 'Vedalken Shackles', 'Verdurous Gearhulk', 'Wurmcoil Engine']
